# Allowlist style: exclude everything, then admit exactly what the Dockerfile
# COPYs (pyproject.toml, poetry.lock, README.md, src/, alembic/, alembic.ini, LICENSE).
# This guarantees secrets and local state (.env, config/, data/, .git/,
# databases, virtualenvs) can never leak into the build context — relevant
# both locally and for remote builders, which receive the whole context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!README.md
!src
!alembic
!alembic.ini
!LICENSE

# Never re-admit caches from inside the allowed trees.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
